      "camera": "wide",
      "voiceUrl": "v_s12_a3361dff.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "speakerCharacterId": "player",
      "speaker": "タカシ",
      "text": "だ、誰だあんた！？",
      "camera": "medium"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "speakerCharacterId": "god",
      "speaker": "女神",
      "text": "この地を統べる女神です。煮え切らない腑抜けには、試練を与えます",
      "avatars": {
        "god": {
          "expression": "neutral",
          "expressionWeight": 1,
          "motion": "Standing Idle"
        }
      },
      "voiceUrl": "v_s14_7ece8eba.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "speakerCharacterId": "god",
      "speaker": "女神",
      "text": "２１日目の夕方、この神社で。私がＧＯと言ったら――５秒以内に、想う相手へ本心を告げなさい",
      "camera": "close",
      "avatars": {
        "god": {
          "motion": "pose_point_go"
        }
      },
      "voiceUrl": "v_s15_7444619d.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "speakerCharacterId": "player",
      "speaker": "タカシ",
      "text": "ご、５秒！？　っていうか想う相手って誰――",
      "camera": "medium"
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "speakerCharacterId": "god",
      "speaker": "女神",
      "text": "偽りの言葉は通じません。言えなければ……天罰の雷で、黒焦げです",
      "avatars": {
        "god": {
          "expression": "nima",
          "expressionWeight": 1
        }
      },
      "focusLines": true,
      "voiceUrl": "v_s17_9e21cb52.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "speakerCharacterId": "player",
      "speaker": "タカシ",
      "text": "く、黒焦げ！？",
      "avatars": {
        "god": {
          "expression": "neutral",
          "expressionWeight": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "speakerCharacterId": "god",
      "speaker": "女神",
      "text": "せいぜい足掻きなさい、人の子よ",
      "avatars": {
        "god": {
          "expression": "happy",
          "expressionWeight": 1,
          "motion": "Ohoho"
        }
